        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 250.95,
          "end": 252.9,
          "en": "So what's happened behind the scenes is,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 252.9,
          "end": 254.82,
          "en": "if you go back to the topic of Spring MVC,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 254.82,
          "end": 256.8,
          "en": "we have talked about different layers, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 256.8,
          "end": 259.32,
          "en": "We have a client, client sends request to the server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 259.32,
          "end": 261.63,
          "en": "But for all the controllers in your server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 261.63,
          "end": 264.24,
          "en": "you'll be having a front controller",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 264.24,
          "end": 265.56,
          "en": "which is called dispatcher servlet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 265.56,
          "end": 267.63,
          "en": "So request goes from the client to dispatcher servlet,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 267.63,
          "end": 268.74,
          "en": "dispatcher servlet sends request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 268.74,
          "end": 270.24,
          "en": "to the particular controller.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 270.24,
          "end": 273.54,
          "en": "But even before your dispatcher servlet,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 273.54,
          "end": 275.43,
          "en": "the moment you add Spring Security,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 275.43,
          "end": 279.06,
          "en": "it adds one more layer of Spring Security,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 279.06,
          "end": 282.6,
          "en": "and inside this layer you'll be having multiple filters.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 282.6,
          "end": 285.39,
          "en": "Let's talk about those filters in the next video, okay?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 285.39,
          "end": 288.33,
          "en": "But then you'll be having filters which will verify",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 288.33,
          "end": 291.12,
          "en": "should we send this request to the next path,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 291.12,
          "end": 293.52,
          "en": "which is your dispatcher servlet, okay?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 293.52,
          "end": 295.11,
          "en": "So let's discuss more about filters",
          "zh": ""
